    "Which also means you can choose the seat you want in the classroom."
    "You have tried all kinds of variation."
    "Back row seats usually are for the 'players', and the front row seats are for the 'nerds', as for the middle seats, just not so special."
    "You're bascially the master of seats at this point, and you understand there's no point in overthinking about the seats."
    "So you make your choice and take a seat."
    "Not knowing what to do, you put on your headphone and start to play with your phone."
    scene black
    "Some time later..."
